{"id":"6c8f804f98505ae8","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-cofinal.md","title":"Cofinal Set","display":"df-cofinal — Cofinal Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-cofinal","aliases":["58-df-cofinal"],"display":"df-cofinal — Cofinal Set","depends_on":["[[58-df-ordinal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-cofinal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-cofinal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-cofinal — Cofinal Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,C\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,C\\in V\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\kappa)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cofinal}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Cofinal}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cofinal} \\vdash \\mathrm{Cofinal}_S(C,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\kappa)\\land C\\subseteq\\kappa\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;\\exists\\beta\\in C\\;(\\alpha\\in\\beta\\lor\\alpha=\\beta)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cofinal} \\vdash \\mathrm{Cofinal}_S(C,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\kappa)\\land C\\subseteq\\kappa\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;\\exists\\beta\\in C\\;(\\alpha\\in\\beta\\lor\\alpha=\\beta)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Unbounded subsets meet every club.</li>\n<li>The cofinality of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> is the least size of an unbounded subset.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\kappa,C\\in V$, $\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\kappa)$ (see [[58-df-ordinal]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa,C\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cofinal}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cofinal} \\vdash \\mathrm{Cofinal}_S(C,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\kappa)\\land C\\subseteq\\kappa\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;\\exists\\beta\\in C\\;(\\alpha\\in\\beta\\lor\\alpha=\\beta)","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false}],"bytes":709,"backlinks":[{"id":"594edc2327167906","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"567cf4d8b6193602","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"2c0a77f933fa6045","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"1ee2b593ec05b4c2","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cofinal}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[../batch09/58-df-cofinal.md]])."},{"id":"34d2157a44d